# Every text file in this repository is LF, in the stored blob and in the working
# tree on every machine. `eol=lf` intentionally overrides any local core.autocrlf.
#
# Why: clasp writes LF, a Windows checkout was CRLF, so `clasp pull` made whole
# files look modified with no content change and real edits became invisible in
# the diff. See .agents/skills/SKILL.md, Line Ending Invariant.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip  binary
*.mp4  binary
